user_prompt_template:
Given this HC review context:
{{context}}

Generate an executive summary as JSON with exactly these keys: headline (string, one sentence), summary (string, 2-3 paragraphs), top_themes (array of strings, 3-5 items), confidence (one of 'low'|'medium'|'high'), gaps (array of strings - evidence that is missing). Keep the summary specific to the company described in the review.

Given this HC review context:
{{context}}

Identify the most material findings as JSON with these keys: strengths (array of {area, dimension, description, impact}), gaps (array of {area, dimension, description, severity}), contradictions (array of {area, element_a, element_b, nature}). impact ∈ low|medium|high; severity ∈ minor|moderate|major|critical.

Given this HC review context:
{{context}}

Produce a risk assessment JSON with keys: summary (string), risks (array of {title, category, likelihood, impact, risk_score, description, mitigation, owner}), unverified_risks (array of strings). category ∈ strategic|operational|people|technology|financial|external; likelihood/impact ∈ low|medium|high; risk_score is likelihood×impact mapped to 1-9.

Given this HC review context:
{{context}}

Produce strategic recommendations as JSON with keys: recommendations (array of {id, title, rationale, priority, effort, impact, owner, dependencies, inferred}), quick_wins (array of {title, description, expected_impact, timeframe}), assumptions (array of strings). priority ∈ low|medium|high|critical; effort ∈ low|medium|high; impact ∈ low|medium|high.

Given this HC review context:
{{context}}

Produce an industry context JSON with keys: industry (string), positioning (string, 2 paragraphs), peer_comparisons (array of {metric, organisation_value, peer_value, gap}), trends (array of strings), data_caveats (array of strings).
